================================================================================

[EPIC-01] Identity, Device Registry & Tenant Trust Mesh (S01, S02)
Goal: Establish tenant-isolated security boundaries, OIDC SSO, mutual TLS, and physical device attestation for cloud and plant edge topologies.

* STORY-01.1: Tenant-Partitioned Identity & Access Service (S01)
  - Implement S01 schema with PostgreSQL RLS: tenants, plants, lines, users, roles, grants.
  - Implement JWT/OIDC authentication with plant-level offline caching of signed role grants.
  - Deliver screen ADM-03 (Roles and Separation of Duties Workbench).
  - Acceptance Test: A41 (Unauthorized operator cannot approve cut overage or carton waiver).

* STORY-01.2: Hardware Device Trust & Credential Provisioning (S02)
  - Implement S02 device registry schema: device ID, MAC, mTLS x509 cert fingerprints, zone, station assignment.
  - Characterize hardware attestation and periodic session rotation for industrial Android tablets and Zebra handheld sleds.
  - Deliver screen ADM-02 (Devices, Readers and Tags Console).
  - Acceptance Test: A12 (Reject unauthorized device credentials; detect suspect duplicate device pings).

[EPIC-02] Controlled Document Intake & Precedence Engine (S03)
Goal: Ingest, extract, and reconcile authoritative commercial and technical documents without silently mutating approved production parameters.

* STORY-02.1: Multi-Format Document Ingestion & Storage Pipeline (S03)
