  - Implement schema: documents, document_revisions, field_assertions, approvals, supersedes_document_id.
  - Integrate async parsing queue for PDF, CSV, and XLSX tech pack extraction.
  - Acceptance Test: A06 (Archiving original document cannot erase approved extracted assertions and source hash).

* STORY-02.2: Field Precedence & Conflicting Revision Resolution Desk (S03)
  - Build precedence matrix enforcing: Buyer PO controls SKU volume, Buyer Tech Pack controls construction POM, IE OB controls routing.
  - Deliver screens MER-03 (Style / Document Variance Desk) and ADM-06 (Document/Rule Revision Audit).
  - Acceptance Test: A02 (Import page-specific dates; flag conflicting delivery milestones without reclassification).

[EPIC-03] Product Master, BOM Graph & Order Lifecycle (S04, S06, S07)
Goal: Model garment specifications, multi-level BOMs, buyer purchase orders, and commercial quotation baselines.

* STORY-03.1: Style Master, Graded POM & SKU Hierarchy (S04)
  - Implement S04 relational schema: styles, style_revisions, skus, boms, pom_dimensions, tolerance_rules.
  - Enforce immutable versioning: publishing style revision generates new UUIDv7, preserving in-flight production links.
  - Acceptance Test: A04 (Resolve size-conditioned 7-loop pattern for sizes 30–42; isolate 9-loop variants).

* STORY-03.2: Commercial Purchase Orders & Amendment Versioning (S06)
  - Implement S06 schema: customer_po, po_lines, requested_deliveries, change_orders.
  - Deliver screens SAL-03 (Sales Order & PO Amendment) and CST-02 (Order Book / Margin Pipeline).
  - Acceptance Test: A01 (Import PO REP1/REP2 separately; seven SKU quantities reproduce exact 129,000 units).

* STORY-03.3: Pre-Production Quotation & Standard Costing Studio (S07)
  - Implement S07 cost calculation engine: direct fabric, trim BOM, SAM direct labor, thread factor, and margin targets.
  - Deliver screens CST-01 (Enquiry Costing Studio) and SAL-02 (Quote / RFQ Pipeline).
  - Acceptance Test: A47 (Order costing engine never interprets buyer unit price as contribution margin).

[EPIC-04] OB Routing DAG Compiler & Pre-Production Gate (S05)
Goal: Compile linear Operation Bulletins into validated, acyclic Directed Acyclic Graphs with branch/merge logic and evidence rules.

* STORY-04.1: Operation Master & Route DAG Graph Compiler (S05)
  - Implement route compiler validating DAG properties: acyclicity, reachability, balanced incoming/outgoing piece ratios.
  - Support node kinds: operation, inspect, split, join, transfer, buffer, bypass, consume-bulk.
  - Deliver screen OB-01 (OB Authoring / Costing Workbench) and IE-01 (Operation Master).
  - Acceptance Test: A08 (Reject missing DAG prerequisite, circular dependency, or invalid machine type).

* STORY-04.2: Engineering Conflict Gate & Route Publication (S05)
  - Enforce cross-document gate: block route publication if fabric/fit differs between tech pack and OB.
  - Deliver screen OB-02 (OB Execution Allocation Console).
  - Acceptance Test: A03 (Quarantine polyester straight-fit OB when bound to cotton twill pleated pants tech pack).

